    "content": "<h1>Product Operation and Development</h1>\n<p>[individual_projects_and_achievements](Product%20Operation%20and%20Development/individual_projects_and_achievements%203e0ef30fe8c581efb8ecf9e1c054120b.md)</p>\n<p>[individual_responsibilities](Product%20Operation%20and%20Development/individual_responsibilities%203e0ef30fe8c581438e93c3f13573bccb.md)</p>\n<p>[learning_and_development](Product%20Operation%20and%20Development/learning_and_development%203e0ef30fe8c5813cab83e642c2b053d7.md)</p>\n<p>[problems_and_blockers](Product%20Operation%20and%20Development/problems_and_blockers%203e0ef30fe8c581268aceecc4181c7544.md)</p>\n<p>[README](Product%20Operation%20and%20Development/README%203e0ef30fe8c581839fa4eb0a04c05631.md)</p>\n<p>[squad_1_google_maps_research](Product%20Operation%20and%20Development/squad_1_google_maps_research%203e0ef30fe8c581b1911af74d79fd1ad6.md)</p>\n<p>[squad_2_whatsapp_outreach](Product%20Operation%20and%20Development/squad_2_whatsapp_outreach%203e0ef30fe8c58130a195da8daf117fc1.md)</p>\n<p>[squad_3_instagram_acquisition](Product%20Operation%20and%20Development/squad_3_instagram_acquisition%203e0ef30fe8c581869498f4b03085ba14.md)</p>\n<p>[squad_4_onboarding_and_activation](Product%20Operation%20and%20Development/squad_4_onboarding_and_activation%203e0ef30fe8c58165ad26ca68a5dfe5f2.md)</p>\n<p>[squad_5_analytics_and_optimization](Product%20Operation%20and%20Development/squad_5_analytics_and_optimization%203e0ef30fe8c5817082fee39e15f8afc2.md)</p>",
