    "content": "<h1>Team Instagram</h1>\n<h1>Team Instagram — Merchant Data Sourcing Engine</h1>\n<h3>🎯 3 Focus Categories for Phase 1</h3>\n<li>👗 <strong>Fashion & Apparel</strong> (Boutiques, thrift, streetwear, clothing, accessories)</li>\n<li>⚽ <strong>Sports & Fitness</strong> (Activewear, sportswear, gym gear, sports equipment)</li>\n<li>📱 <strong>Electronics & Mobiles</strong> (Mobile skins, accessories, gadgets, repair hubs)</li>\n<p>---</p>\n<h3>👑 Territory & Category Ownership (Katraj ↔ Swargate Radar)</h3>\n<p>| Team Member | Assigned Category | Primary Geographic Territory (Katraj to Swargate) |<br/>| --- | --- | --- |<br/>| <strong>Shweta Chavan</strong> | 👗 Fashion & Apparel | <strong>Katraj Chowk & PICT / Bharati Vidyapeeth area</strong> |<br/>| <strong>Dhiren Lodha</strong> | 👗 Fashion & Apparel | <strong>Dhankawadi, Mohan Nagar & Trimurti Chowk</strong> |<br/>| <strong>Khushi Gupta</strong> | 👗 Fashion & Apparel | <strong>Padmavati, KK Market & Satara Road</strong> |<br/>| <strong>Neha Bhoye</strong> | ⚽ Sports & Fitness | <strong>Bibwewadi, Sahakar Nagar & Market Yard</strong> |<br/>| <strong>Krishna Israni</strong> | 📱 Electronics & Mobiles | <strong>Swargate, Mukund Nagar & Aranyeshwar</strong> |</p>\n<p>---</p>\n<h3>🔍 How to Find & Qualify Leads (Step-by-Step SOP)</h3>\n<p>1. <strong>Open Instagram</strong> and search your assigned micro-area on Satara Road / Katraj–Swargate stretch:</p>\n<p>• <strong>Direct Account / Keyword Search:</strong> Search directly for shop accounts like</p>\n<p><code>shoes pune</code>, <code>boutique katraj</code>, <code>mobile accessories pune</code>, <code>sports store satara road</code>.</p>\n<li><strong>Places / Location Tags:</strong> <code>Katraj</code>, <code>Dhankawadi</code>, <code>Satara Road</code>, <code>Bibwewadi</code>, <code>Sahakar Nagar</code>, <code>Swargate Pune</code>.</li>\n<li><strong>Local Hashtags:</strong> <code>#katrajshopping</code>, <code>#dhankawadiboutique</code>, <code>#satararoadpune</code>, <code>#puneshopping</code>.</li>\n1. <strong>Filter for Quality:</strong>\n    - ✅ <strong>Good:</strong> Active accounts with a physical retail store in the Katraj–Swargate belt.\n    - ❌ <strong>Skip:</strong> Inactive pages (no posts in 30+ days), pan-India dropshippers with no local store, meme accounts.\n2. <strong>Extract Contact:</strong> Check their <strong>Bio</strong>, <strong>Contact Button</strong>, or <strong>Linktree</strong> to extract a valid WhatsApp/mobile number.\n3. <strong>Log into the Notion CRM Table below:</strong>\n    - <code>Store Name</code>\n    - <code>Instagram Profile Link</code>\n    - <code>WhatsApp Number</code> (Must be valid 10-digit number)\n    - <code>Category</code> (Fashion / Sports / Electronics)\n    - <code>Created By</code> (Your Name)\n    - <code>Status</code> ➔ Set to Unassigned\n<p>---</p>\n<h3>📋 Team Instagram CRM Table</h3>\n<p>| Store Name | Instagram Profile Link | WhatsApp Number | Category | Assigned To | Status |<br/>| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |<br/>| <em>Example Boutique</em> | [<em>https://instagram.com/](https://instagram.com/)...</em> | <em>9876543210</em> | <em>Fashion</em> | <em>Shweta Chavan</em> | <em>not assigned</em> |</p>\n<p>For CRM go to : [crm.vipto.in](http://crm.vipto.in)</p>",
