    "content": "<h1>Product Communication</h1>\n<p>[app_link_sharing](Product%20Communication/app_link_sharing%203e0ef30fe8c581c1b89edba0e8fb147f.md)</p>\n<p>[communication_dos_and_donts](Product%20Communication/communication_dos_and_donts%203e0ef30fe8c58145b25ed7f203cf619a.md)</p>\n<p>[first_message_templates](Product%20Communication/first_message_templates%203e0ef30fe8c581afa89bc92be13aebe4.md)</p>\n<p>[follow_up_templates](Product%20Communication/follow_up_templates%203e0ef30fe8c58134a1e7d5fcdfbf03e3.md)</p>\n<p>[instagram_dms](Product%20Communication/instagram_dms%203e0ef30fe8c58142b6aadcbd4248edc3.md)</p>\n<p>[interested_seller_response](Product%20Communication/interested_seller_response%203e0ef30fe8c5816a8c2afb0ca9384f9d.md)</p>\n<p>[outreach_sop](Product%20Communication/outreach_sop%203e0ef30fe8c581708bd5f9b35a116c57.md)</p>\n<p>[README](Product%20Communication/README%203e0ef30fe8c581599decee23f1139202.md)</p>\n<p>[seller_objection_handling](Product%20Communication/seller_objection_handling%203e0ef30fe8c581e4bdc5fc33cae28867.md)</p>\n<p>[whatsapp_business](Product%20Communication/whatsapp_business%203e0ef30fe8c581548c02e0402d6a7d48.md)</p>",
