    "title": "README",
    "slug": "readme",
    "icon": "💡",
    "content": "<h1>README</h1>\n<h1>📚 Learn Vipto — Overview & Roadmap</h1>\n<h2>PAGE INFORMATION</h2>\n<li><strong>Page Name:</strong> Learn Vipto — Topic Overview</li>\n<li><strong>Purpose:</strong> Provide an overarching roadmap and navigation portal for understanding Vipto’s core product, value proposition, and marketplace mechanics.</li>\n<li><strong>Section:</strong> 2. 📚 Learn Vipto</li>\n<h2>Overview</h2>\n<p>Before contacting any local merchant, every Product Operations intern must have a thorough, fluent understanding of <strong>Vipto</strong>. Vipto is a hyperlocal product discovery platform that helps customers find products available in nearby local stores before visiting them in person. Our guiding principle is: <strong>“Search Online. Confirm Availability. Buy Offline.”</strong></p>\n<h2>Why This Matters</h2>\n<p>Merchants immediately sense when a representative does not understand their own product. When speaking to local shop owners, you are the voice of Vipto. Fluency in our request-based availability model, customer benefits, and seller tools allows you to answer questions instantly, overcome skepticism, and demonstrate how Vipto drives real foot-traffic customers to their store counters.</p>\n<h2>Objectives</h2>\n<li>Master the core concept of Vipto: <em>“Search Online. Confirm Availability. Buy Offline.”</em></li>\n<li>Understand the unique gap Vipto fills compared to Amazon, Flipkart, Google Maps, and Justdial.</li>\n<li>Master the dual-app architecture: Vipto Customer App and Vipto Seller App.</li>\n<li>Learn why local retailers join Vipto (zero inventory hassle, high foot-traffic sales, simple one-tap response).</li>\n<li>Confidently answer common merchant FAQs and live objections.</li>\n<h2>How It Works</h2>\n<p>Study this section thoroughly before conducting discovery or outreach. Test both mobile applications directly and review each sub-page to build complete domain mastery.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-text\">Product Concept ──&gt; Dual App Architecture ──&gt; Target Personas ──&gt; Value Props ──&gt; FAQs & Live Scripts\n</code></pre>\n<h2>Section Navigation</h2>\n<p>| Sub-Page | Focus Area | Key Takeaway |<br/>| --- | --- | --- |<br/>| [What is Vipto?](./what_is_vipto.md) | Product definition & problem statement | Hyperlocal discovery: Search Online. Confirm Availability. Buy Offline. |<br/>| [Vipto User App](./vipto_user_app.md) | Customer application experience | How buyers search products and send availability requests |<br/>| [Vipto Seller App](./vipto_seller_app.md) | Shop owner application & tools | How sellers upload items and respond <em>Available / Not Available</em> |<br/>| [Who Are Our Sellers?](./who_are_our_sellers.md) | Target retail categories & store types | Electronics, clothing, sports, groceries, medical, gifts |<br/>| [Why Should Sellers Join Vipto?](./why_should_sellers_join_vipto.md) | Core merchant value proposition | Digital visibility, zero inventory maintenance, foot-traffic sales |<br/>| [Seller Journey](./seller_journey.md) | Full merchant lifecycle | From discovery and registration to active availability responder |<br/>| [User Journey](./user_journey.md) | Customer discovery & shopping lifecycle | Search ──► Check Availability ──► Confirm ──► Visit Store |<br/>| [Vipto Business Model](./vipto_business_model.md) | Marketplace economics & long-term vision | Free setup, merchant-aligned growth, future roadmap |<br/>| [Seller FAQs](./seller_faqs.md) | Foundational operational Q&A | Essential answers every intern must know |<br/>| [Common Seller Questions](./common_seller_questions.md) | Practical live objection scripts | Exact answers to use in WhatsApp and Instagram chats |</p>\n<h2>Roles & Responsibilities</h2>\n<li><strong>Squad 1 & 3 (Discovery):</strong> Use these pages to verify whether a discovered retail shop matches Vipto’s category profile.</li>\n<li><strong>Squad 2 & 3 (Outreach):</strong> Internalize the value propositions and scripts to handle chat conversations with shop owners.</li>\n<li><strong>Squad 5 (Analytics):</strong> Audit seller feedback against these core product claims to detect operational gaps.</li>\n<li><strong>Squad 4 (Onboarding):</strong> Master the Seller App guide to provide seamless walkthroughs to newly registered merchants.</li>\n<h2>Best Practices</h2>\n<li>Practice explaining Vipto’s core tagline: <em>“Search Online. Confirm Availability. Buy Offline.”</em></li>\n<li>Emphasize to merchants that Vipto brings paying customers into their physical store rather than competing with them.</li>\n<li>Highlight how effortless the Seller App is—responding to requests takes just one tap.</li>\n<h2>Common Mistakes</h2>\n<li>Pitching Vipto as an e-commerce home delivery service or warehouse parcel courier.</li>\n<li>Claiming that shop owners need complex barcode scanners or inventory tracking systems.</li>\n<li>Hesitating when asked how customers find the shop (map navigation in the Customer App).</li>\n<h2>Quick Summary</h2>\n<li>Vipto is a hyperlocal product discovery platform that connects nearby shoppers with local stores.</li>\n<li>It solves the problem of customers traveling to multiple shops blindly by confirming real-time availability.</li>\n<li>The Customer App lets buyers search items, check availability, and navigate to the store.</li>\n<li>The Seller App gives shop owners a simple tool to upload products and respond with one tap.</li>\n<li>Review all sub-pages in this section thoroughly to build complete product confidence.</li>\n<h2>Related Pages</h2>\n<li>[What is Vipto?](./what_is_vipto.md)</li>\n<li>[Vipto Seller App](./vipto_seller_app.md)</li>\n<li>[Why Should Sellers Join Vipto?](./why_should_sellers_join_vipto.md)</li>\n<li>[Seller FAQs](./seller_faqs.md)</li>\n<li>[Common Seller Questions](./common_seller_questions.md)</li>\n<h2>Resources</h2>\n<li>[Vipto Product Demo Video [To be defined by Vipto]]</li>\n<li>[Vipto Seller App Download [To be defined by Vipto]]</li>",
