    "slug": "seller-faqs",
    "icon": "💡",
    "content": "<h1>seller_faqs</h1>\n<h1>📚 Seller FAQs — Frequently Asked Questions</h1>\n<h2>PAGE INFORMATION</h2>\n<li><strong>Page Name:</strong> Seller FAQs</li>\n<li><strong>Purpose:</strong> Compile comprehensive foundational questions and answers that interns must know to handle merchant inquiries about Vipto.</li>\n<li><strong>Section:</strong> 2. 📚 Learn Vipto</li>\n<h2>Overview</h2>\n<p>This document contains the foundational <strong>Frequently Asked Questions (FAQs)</strong> regarding Vipto’s product discovery platform, seller registration, product uploads, availability request handling, and commercial terms. Every intern must master these answers.</p>\n<h2>Why This Matters</h2>\n<p>During outreach and onboarding, local shop owners ask specific questions about how Vipto works and what is required of them. Answering quickly, accurately, and confidently establishes immediate trust and prevents hesitation.</p>\n<h2>Objectives</h2>\n<li>Master all foundational platform FAQs across general, product, operational, and commercial categories.</li>\n<li>Explain the difference between Vipto and delivery/e-commerce platforms.</li>\n<li>Understand the one-tap availability response workflow.</li>\n<li>Ensure unified communication across all 11 interns.</li>\n<h2>Master FAQ Knowledge Base</h2>\n<h3>1. General & Concept</h3>\n<p><strong>Q1: What is Vipto?</strong><br/><blockquote><p><strong>A:</strong> Vipto is a hyperlocal product discovery platform that helps customers find products in nearby local stores before visiting them in person. Our motto is: <em>“Search Online. Confirm Availability. Buy Offline.”</em></p></blockquote></p>\n<p><strong>Q2: How is Vipto different from Google Maps or Justdial?</strong><br/><blockquote><p><strong>A:</strong> Google Maps and Justdial show where your shop is located, but they don’t show what products you have inside. Vipto allows nearby shoppers to search for specific items (like a laptop charger or sports grip) and confirm that you have it in stock before visiting.</p></blockquote></p>\n<p><strong>Q3: How is Vipto different from Amazon or Flipkart?</strong><br/><blockquote><p><strong>A:</strong> Amazon and Flipkart deliver parcels from distant warehouses in 2–4 days. Vipto connects nearby customers with your physical shop, allowing them to walk in, inspect the item in person, and buy it immediately.</p></blockquote></p>\n<p>---</p>\n<h3>2. Registration & Setup</h3>\n<p><strong>Q4: Is there any registration or monthly software fee?</strong><br/><blockquote><p><strong>A:</strong> No. Joining Vipto is 100% free during our launch phase. There are no sign-up fees, listing charges, or monthly software subscriptions.</p></blockquote></p>\n<p><strong>Q5: How many products do I need to upload to get started?</strong><br/><blockquote><p><strong>A:</strong> You can start with just 5 to 10 of your most popular or frequently requested items. You do not need to upload your entire store inventory.</p></blockquote></p>\n<p><strong>Q6: Do I need a computer or barcode scanner?</strong><br/><blockquote><p><strong>A:</strong> Not at all! The Vipto Seller App is designed 100% for your smartphone. You can upload products, manage items, and respond to customer requests in seconds.</p></blockquote></p>\n<p><strong>Q7: Can your team help me upload my products?</strong><br/><blockquote><p><strong>A:</strong> Yes! Our onboarding team provides free assisted setup. You can simply send us photos and prices of your top items on WhatsApp, and we will upload them for you.</p></blockquote></p>\n<p>---</p>\n<h3>3. Availability Requests & Customer Sales</h3>\n<p><strong>Q8: What happens when a customer sends an availability request?</strong><br/><blockquote><p><strong>A:</strong> Your phone rings with a notification showing the product photo and inquiry. You simply tap <strong>“Available”</strong> or <strong>“Not Available”</strong>. It takes just one tap and zero typing.</p></blockquote></p>\n<p><strong>Q9: Does Vipto deliver the products to the customer’s home?</strong><br/><blockquote><p><strong>A:</strong> Vipto is a product discovery platform, not a delivery company. When you confirm availability, the customer uses map navigation in the app to walk into your shop and buy directly from your counter.</p></blockquote></p>\n<p><strong>Q10: What if an item is out of stock when a request arrives?</strong><br/><blockquote><p><strong>A:</strong> Simply tap <strong>“Not Available”</strong>. The customer will be notified, and you can update the item status in the app whenever you like.</p></blockquote></p>\n<p>---</p>\n<h2>Roles & Responsibilities</h2>\n<li><strong>Squad 1 & 3:</strong> Use FAQs to determine seller eligibility and answer discovery inquiries.</li>\n<li><strong>Squad 2:</strong> Rely on these answers during WhatsApp outreach conversations.</li>\n<li><strong>Squad 4:</strong> Walk through app and product FAQs during onboarding calls.</li>\n<li><strong>Squad 5:</strong> Update this repository as new merchant questions emerge.</li>\n<h2>Best Practices</h2>\n<li>Keep answers concise, clear, and reassuring.</li>\n<li>Always emphasize the simplicity: one tap to respond, no delivery hassle, free to join.</li>\n<li>If a question is not covered here, escalate to your squad lead rather than guessing.</li>\n<h2>Common Mistakes</h2>\n<li>Telling merchants that Vipto handles shipping logistics or charges delivery fees.</li>\n<li>Claiming that shop owners need to upload thousands of SKUs before going live.</li>\n<li>Giving conflicting information about platform costs.</li>\n<h2>Checklist</h2>\n<li data-checked=\"true\" data-type=\"taskItem\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\" checked=\"checked\"><span></span></label><div><p> Read through all 10 foundational FAQs.</p></div></li>\n<li data-checked=\"true\" data-type=\"taskItem\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\" checked=\"checked\"><span></span></label><div><p> Practice answering each question out loud without notes.</p></div></li>\n<li data-checked=\"true\" data-type=\"taskItem\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\" checked=\"checked\"><span></span></label><div><p> Save key answers in WhatsApp Business Quick Replies.</p></div></li>\n<li data-checked=\"true\" data-type=\"taskItem\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\" checked=\"checked\"><span></span></label><div><p> Read [Common Seller Questions](./common_seller_questions.md).</p></div></li>\n<h2>Metrics / Success Criteria</h2>\n<li><strong>FAQ Mastery:</strong> 100% passing score on the Week 1 Product Knowledge Check.</li>\n<li><strong>Consistent Messaging:</strong> Zero misinformed commitments made to prospective merchants.</li>\n<h2>Quick Summary</h2>\n<li>Vipto is a hyperlocal product discovery platform: <em>“Search Online. Confirm Availability. Buy Offline.”</em></li>\n<li>Differentiates from Google Maps (shows products, not just addresses) and Amazon (instant offline purchase).</li>\n<li>100% free to join with no monthly software subscriptions.</li>\n<li>Shop owners need only a smartphone; assisted onboarding helps list 5–10 items in minutes.</li>\n<li>When customers check availability, the merchant responds with a single tap (<em>Available / Not Available</em>).</li>\n<h2>Related Pages</h2>\n<li>[Common Seller Questions](./common_seller_questions.md)</li>\n<li>[What is Vipto?](./what_is_vipto.md)</li>\n<li>[Why Should Sellers Join Vipto?](./why_should_sellers_join_vipto.md)</li>\n<li>[Vipto Seller App](./vipto_seller_app.md)</li>\n<li>[Seller Objection Handling](../06_seller_outreach_and_communication/seller_objection_handling.md)</li>\n<h2>Resources</h2>\n<li>[Vipto Master FAQ Reference [To be defined by Vipto]]</li>",
