    "content": "<h1>Learn Vipto</h1>\n<p>[common_seller_questions](Learn%20Vipto/common_seller_questions%203dfef30fe8c5811bbe62f22f952319d9.md)</p>\n<p>[README](Learn%20Vipto/README%203dfef30fe8c5810da672e15d4b1a1e90.md)</p>\n<p>[seller_faqs](Learn%20Vipto/seller_faqs%203dfef30fe8c5814b9f08d0b6d8e80624.md)</p>\n<p>[seller_journey](Learn%20Vipto/seller_journey%203dfef30fe8c581db9d27d441c6d59b8b.md)</p>\n<p>[user_journey](Learn%20Vipto/user_journey%203dfef30fe8c581b5a68dc197c7a97482.md)</p>\n<p>[vipto_business_model](Learn%20Vipto/vipto_business_model%203dfef30fe8c5817097dcef5e0e72de30.md)</p>\n<p>[vipto_seller_app](Learn%20Vipto/vipto_seller_app%203dfef30fe8c581d7ae8dfccedc9f64e0.md)</p>\n<p>[vipto_user_app](Learn%20Vipto/vipto_user_app%203dfef30fe8c5816cbc24f1dd39d0b316.md)</p>\n<p>[what_is_vipto](Learn%20Vipto/what_is_vipto%203dfef30fe8c5818a98c8fa2da3ce10b3.md)</p>\n<p>[who_are_our_sellers](Learn%20Vipto/who_are_our_sellers%203dfef30fe8c581689e9afd4f6bf4155a.md)</p>",
