    "content": "<h1>Product Crm</h1>\n<p>[crm_pipeline_stages](Product%20Crm/crm_pipeline_stages%203e0ef30fe8c58188b965c781d90772d9.md)</p>\n<p>[crm_rules_and_duplicate_management](Product%20Crm/crm_rules_and_duplicate_management%203e0ef30fe8c5818dad93fe0c6eddce4c.md)</p>\n<p>[follow_up_management](Product%20Crm/follow_up_management%203e0ef30fe8c581fca362f7e5e7bd9efb.md)</p>\n<p>[how_to_add_a_seller](Product%20Crm/how_to_add_a_seller%203e0ef30fe8c581119e0bf20c38ab2c6e.md)</p>\n<p>[hubspot_introduction](Product%20Crm/hubspot_introduction%203e0ef30fe8c581bb8532efa7b33655d1.md)</p>\n<p>[lead_assignment_and_status_updates](Product%20Crm/lead_assignment_and_status_updates%203e0ef30fe8c581338ffddf737a95cbe9.md)</p>\n<p>[README](Product%20Crm/README%203e0ef30fe8c581699238cdd06662110b.md)</p>\n<p>[required_seller_information](Product%20Crm/required_seller_information%203e0ef30fe8c58101ba93cbe81b1336ed.md)</p>\n<p>[seller_lead_database](Product%20Crm/seller_lead_database%203e0ef30fe8c581cf97e5f64e04b90a2b.md)</p>",
