    "icon": "🎓",
    "content": "<h1>README</h1>\n<h1>🎓 Vipto Product, Growth & Operations Learning Academy</h1>\n<blockquote><p><strong>“From Foundational Principles to Scaled Execution.”</strong></p></blockquote>\nThe official comprehensive learning curriculum for Product Operations, Growth Strategy, Market Research, CRM Architecture, and Product-Led Experimentation.\n<blockquote><p></p></blockquote>\n<p>---</p>\n<h2>📌 Learning Modules Overview & Navigation</h2>\n<p>This learning module series equips team members with world-class frameworks used at high-growth technology companies and top startup accelerators. Each module combines <strong>core theoretical frameworks</strong>, <strong>tactical step-by-step implementation playbooks</strong>, <strong>curated YouTube video masterclasses from top industry leaders</strong>, and <strong>authoritative reading references</strong>.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-text\">🎓 VIPTO LEARNING ACADEMY\n│\n├── 🔍 01. Competitive Research & Product Teardowns (01_competitive_research_and_product_teardowns.md)\n│   └── Competitor intelligence, feature parity matrix, JTBD teardown SOP, market positioning\n│\n├── 🗂️ 02. General CRM Fundamentals & Pipeline Management (02_crm_fundamentals_and_pipeline_management.md)\n│   └── Universal CRM data models, 6-stage sales pipelines, lead lifecycle, velocity & hygiene\n│\n├── 🗣️ 03. Voice of Customer & User Feedback Loops (03_voice_of_customer_and_user_feedback_loops.md)\n│   └── Continuous discovery habits, non-leading user interviews (The Mom Test), feedback taxonomy\n│\n├── 🛠️ 04. Feedback-to-Roadmap & Product Improvement (04_feedback_to_product_roadmap_and_improvement.md)\n│   └── Qualitative synthesis, RICE / ICE prioritization, PRD specifications, closing user loops\n│\n├── 🚀 05. Growth Loops & User Acquisition Channels (05_growth_loops_and_user_acquisition_channels.md)\n│   └── Funnels vs loops, viral/content/paid loops, Channel-Product fit, Bullseye framework\n│\n├── 🧪 06. Experimentation & A/B Testing for Scale (06_experimentation_and_ab_testing_for_scale.md)\n│   └── Scientific method, hypothesis formulation, sample sizing, p-values, Twyman's Law, backlogs\n│\n└── 📈 07. Scaling Playbooks & Product Metrics (07_scaling_playbooks_and_product_metrics.md)\n    └── North Star Metric (NSM), input metric trees, cohort retention curves, K-factor math, scaling SOP\n</code></pre>\n<p>---</p>\n<h2>🗺️ Curriculum Matrix & Competency Map</h2>\n<p>| Module # | Module Title | Core Focus Areas | Key Output / Deliverable | Target Mastery Level |<br/>| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |<br/>| <strong>01</strong> | [<strong>Competitive Research & Teardowns</strong>](./01_competitive_research_and_product_teardowns.md) | Market intelligence, competitor UX teardowns, pricing models, feature parity matrix. | 1 Comprehensive Competitive Teardown Report & Feature Matrix. | Advanced Product Research |<br/>| <strong>02</strong> | [<strong>CRM Fundamentals & Pipelines</strong>](./02_crm_fundamentals_and_pipeline_management.md) | Platform-agnostic CRM architecture, lifecycle stages, deal stages, pipeline velocity, data hygiene. | 1 Standardized Pipeline Architecture & Stage Entry/Exit Criteria. | Core Operations & CRM |<br/>| <strong>03</strong> | [<strong>Voice of Customer & Feedback</strong>](./03_voice_of_customer_and_user_feedback_loops.md) | Continuous discovery, non-biased user interviews (<em>The Mom Test</em>), qualitative categorizations. | 5 Live User Discovery Transcripts & Opportunity Tree Mapping. | User Research & Discovery |<br/>| <strong>04</strong> | [<strong>Feedback to Product Roadmap</strong>](./04_feedback_to_product_roadmap_and_improvement.md) | Thematic clustering, RICE scoring, Kano analysis, PRD writing, closing the feedback loop. | 1 One-Page PRD with Prioritized Feature Opportunity Backlog. | Product Strategy & Prioritization |<br/>| <strong>05</strong> | [<strong>Growth Loops & Acquisition</strong>](./05_growth_loops_and_user_acquisition_channels.md) | Self-reinforcing growth loops, PLG vs SLG, CAC/LTV dynamics, Bullseye traction channels. | 1 Mapped Growth Flywheel Loop Model with Channel Hypotheses. | Growth Marketing & Acquisition |<br/>| <strong>06</strong> | [<strong>Experimentation & A/B Testing</strong>](./06_experimentation_and_ab_testing_for_scale.md) | Scientific testing protocols, hypothesis syntax, statistical validity, test velocity. | 1 Experiment Backlog with 5 Test Designs & Success Metrics. | Data-Driven Optimization |<br/>| <strong>07</strong> | [<strong>Scaling & Product Metrics</strong>](./07_scaling_playbooks_and_product_metrics.md) | North Star Metric trees, cohort retention curves, growth accounting, viral K-factors. | 1 Full Product Health Dashboard Schema & 10-Step Scaling Plan. | Growth Analytics & Leadership |</p>\n<p>---</p>\n<h2>📚 How to Complete These Learning Modules</h2>\n<p>1. <strong>Study Core Frameworks:</strong> Read through the deep-dive theoretical and practical explanations on each page.<br/>2. <strong>Watch Curated Video Masterclasses:</strong> Watch the embedded and linked YouTube lectures from world-class product leaders (Y Combinator, Reforge, Lenny’s Podcast, Product School, top academics).<br/>3. <strong>Review Reference Literature:</strong> Explore the hyperlinked articles, seminal books, and whitepapers referenced on each page.<br/>4. <strong>Execute Practical Exercises:</strong> Complete the hands-on project assignments and verify your knowledge using the end-of-module checklists.<br/>5. <strong>Apply to Vipto Operations:</strong> Bridge every theoretical insight directly to improving our seller acquisition, marketplace liquidity, user retention, and platform growth.</p>",
